<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Data Deletion Instructions - FLICKCANVAS</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  <style>
    .privacy-container {
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      padding: 20px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: #eee;
    }
    .privacy-container h1 { margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .privacy-container h2 { margin-top: 30px; }
    .privacy-container p, .privacy-container li { color: #ccc; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/header') %>

  <div class="privacy-container">
    <h1>Data Deletion Instructions</h1>
    <p>Last updated: <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' }) %></p>

    <p>FLICKCANVAS does not collect or store personal data from visitors browsing our website. We do not require account creation, and we do not store any personal information from Facebook or Instagram users through our social media integration.</p>

    <h2>What Data We Process</h2>
    <p>Our Facebook and Instagram integration is used solely to publish content (movie posters and trailers) to our own official pages. We do not collect, store, or process any personal data belonging to Facebook or Instagram users through this integration.</p>

    <h2>Requesting Data Deletion</h2>
    <p>Since we do not store personal user data, there is typically nothing to delete. However, if you believe we have inadvertently stored any information related to you and would like it removed, please contact us at:</p>
    <p><strong>flickcanvasmovies@gmail.com</strong></p>
    <p>We will respond to and process any valid data deletion request within 30 days.</p>
  </div>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>